{"id":1798435,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-16T15:36:51.610Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1798435,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["NL"],"original_language":"nl","original_title":"Het Geheim van Hotel New York","overview":"Few buildings tell the story of a city as vividly as Hotel New York does for Rotterdam. Originally constructed in 1901 as the headquarters of the Holland-America Line, this landmark building has witnessed over a century of commerce, migration, war, decline, and urban renewal. Drawing on a wealth of archival material and a diverse range of interviews, the film weaves together the personal accounts of those who knew the building from the inside with the historical evolution of Rotterdam as a port city. From an office building and squatted property to its eventual transformation into a hotel, \"The Secret of Hotel New York\" presents the story of an enduring symbol of Rotterdam’s capacity for reinvention.","popularity":0.0214,"poster_path":"/yRZVurXwQ4rCuSlYrC5FsXk1OT3.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":159737,"logo_path":null,"name":"Dutch Angle Productions","origin_country":"NL"}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-10-09","revenue":0,"runtime":87,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Dutch","iso_639_1":"nl","name":"Nederlands"},{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The Secret of Hotel New York","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6551612,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Riek Bakker","original_name":"Riek Bakker","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6ad12573752b428d0f625339","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1697335,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Daan van der Have","original_name":"Daan v